hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1801","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Zamaa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khutba detey huey suna jabke Aap ne oontni aur use kaat-ney waley ka zikr kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: (Jab uska badnaseeb utha): Uskey liye sakht izzat wala nafarmaan aadmi utha jo apni qaum mein Abu Zamaa jaisa hai. Aur auraton ka zikr kya aur farmaya: Tum mein se koi jaata hai aur apni biwi ko ghulaam ki maar maarta hai. To shayed wo uskey din key aakhir mein us se lipatta hai. Phir Aap ne unhey unkey paad maarney par hansney mein nasihat ki aur farmaya: Tum mein se koi kyun hansta hai jo wo karta hai? Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Abu Zamaa jaisa jo Zubair bin Awwaam ka chacha hai. (Bukhari: 4942). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Hargiz nahi, agar wo baaz na aaya)."
